  "title": {
   "rendered": "Legend of the Month"
  },
  "content": {
   "rendered": "\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Our special monthly resident reward, for local legends just like you.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-normal-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Every month, we bring you a unique, high value reward from a different business in the city to enjoy. From discounts on walking tours, distillery visits and top attractions, as well as one-off prices at some of the city’s best food and drink spots. Get out there and make your postcode pay.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-light-sandstone-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-light-sandstone-background-color has-background\"/>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-rounded\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/16023929/thumb_75296_point_of_interest_bigger-1.png\" alt=\"Tower of haggis, neeps and tatties with a whisky sauce\" class=\"wp-image-37494\" srcset=\"https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/16023929/thumb_75296_point_of_interest_bigger-1.png 2000w, https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/16023929/thumb_75296_point_of_interest_bigger-1-1280x691.png 1280w, https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/16023929/thumb_75296_point_of_interest_bigger-1-1920x1037.png 1920w, https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/16023929/thumb_75296_point_of_interest_bigger-1-741x400.png 741w, https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/16023929/thumb_75296_point_of_interest_bigger-1-1536x829.png 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-light-sandstone-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-light-sandstone-background-color has-background\"/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-primary-color has-text-color has-large-font-size\"><strong><strong>Mackays on the Mile Legend of the Month for October 2026</strong></strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><strong>30% discount on the food menu at Mackays on the Mile</strong></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Tucked away in one of the Royal Mile’s many ancient closes, right in the heart of Canongate, Mackays on the Mile is a haven from the hustle and bustle of the city centre.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Favouring local produce, they aim to bring the flavours of our beautiful country straight to your plate. Mackays is open daily from 9am for breakfast and serves delicious food until late evening.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Proud of their 100+ bottle selection of whiskies, they also offer a cocktail menu inspired by Scottish distilleries. Or take your pick from the selection of local beers and ciders. Relax on the terrace with views of Calton Hill, sit inside watching a live game of sport, or enjoy live music on the weekend.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Mackays is fully accessible for wheelchair users, and family-friendly with baby-changing facilities in the venue. Plus, they’re also dog-friendly.</p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-light-sandstone-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-light-sandstone-background-color has-background\"/>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-light-sandstone-background-color has-background is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-48365976 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-primary-color has-text-color has-large-font-size\">How to redeem this Reward</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left wp-block-paragraph\">Throughout October, residents with an EH postcode can enjoy 30% discount on the food menu at Mackays on the Mile.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left wp-block-paragraph\">Bookings should be made on&nbsp;<a href=\"https://booking.stampede.ai/v2/bdedfdc0-eae0-11eb-9387-0aac94500235/NYSEBYXHA1M7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mackays on the Mile</a>&nbsp;using&nbsp;code<strong>&nbsp;MACKAYSLOTM26</strong>&nbsp;on the booking form. Alternatively, contact the venue by calling 0131 558 7425, or by emailing&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:reservations@mackaysonthemile.com\">reservations@mackaysonthemile.com</a>&nbsp;and quoting&nbsp;<strong>MACKAYSLOTM26.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-4 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1037\" data-id=\"37469\" src=\"https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/13023948/thumb_75272_point_of_interest_bigger-1920x1037.png\" alt=\"Mackays outside seating,© Old Town Pub Co.\" class=\"wp-image-37469\" srcset=\"https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/13023948/thumb_752",
   "protected": false
  }
 },
