17;s history and heritage to enjoying music, food, wellbeing and outdoor activities, there are plenty of ways to experience something different this Silver Sunday.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"not-prose w-full mx-auto col-span-1 bg-very-light-grey rounded-2xl group\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://edinburgh.org/residentrewards/residentrewarddays/worldtourismday/\"  class=\"h-full flex flex-col\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex justify-center items-center h-48 min-[500px]:h-60 shrink-0 bg-secondary rounded-t-2xl overflow-hidden isolate\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t          \n<img decoding=\"async\" \n  class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 duration-200\"\n  src=\"https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20114407/Resident-Rewards-Website-header-for-World-Tourism-Day-2026-1280x691.jpg\"\n  srcset=\"https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20114407/Resident-Rewards-Website-header-for-World-Tourism-Day-2026-1280x691.jpg 1280w, https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20114407/Resident-Rewards-Website-header-for-World-Tourism-Day-2026-1920x1037.jpg 1920w, https://media.edinburgh.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20114407/Resident-Rewards-Website-header-for-",
